om":"schedule","relation":"depends_on","to":"specific plant"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]}],"prompt_version":"p2-assessor-production-v9","replay_ancestry":[{"root":"531d39ac-24ce-435a-a55d-9a3922dfafb3","source_slot":"s0"},{"root":"7247876f-7311-4690-b312-29404c2d7adb","source_slot":"s1"},{"root":"cb1dc57e-c798-4408-83f1-70c12c4d0cd2","source_slot":"s2"},{"root":"92dfd1f4-db94-4baf-b818-eb2ce0efac84","source_slot":"s3"}],"schema_version":"p2-assessor-v6","source_purpose_mask":["external_evidence","model_output"],"sources":[{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s0","source_id":"531d39ac-24ce-435a-a55d-9a3922dfafb3","text":"I am trying to keep a few balcony plants healthy through hot weather and a short absence. What would you think through first?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s1","source_id":"7247876f-7311-4690-b312-29404c2d7adb","text":"If you're worried about your plants during the heat and while you're away, my first suggestion would be to check how much water your plants actually need. Different plants have different needs!"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s2","source_id":"cb1dc57e-c798-4408-83f1-70c12c4d0cd2","text":"I appreciate the reminder about water needs, but I'm already a bit confused about which plants need more attention. Do you think I should group them by type or something?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s3","source_id":"92dfd1f4-db94-4baf-b818-eb2ce0efac84","text":"Grouping them by type definitely makes sense! It helps keep things organized. For example, you could put your drought-tolerant succulents together and the moisture-loving herbs in a separate group. Does that help narrow down your to-do list a bit?"},{"available":true,"role":"external","slot":"s4","source_id":"397025eb-bd25-459f-af41-260c6edba161","text":"That does help, but I'm still worried about missing something when the heat gets really bad. Do you think I should set up a schedule or something?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s5","source_id":"be80a671-ca43-40b0-b2f6-57fe33141db4","text":"A schedule is a great idea! For a few reasons: it keeps things consistent, and it helps you know exactly when your plants need attention, especially when it's hot outside. Do you want a general watering schedule, or are you looking for a specific daily/weekly schedule based on a specific plant?"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["no_identified_link"],"corresponding_source_slots":["s5"],"credit_eligible":true,"dependence":"no_identified_link","monitor_id":"candidate:e-17a89b6f344dfca7ae7a10ef","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":["s5"],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":295,"quote":"A schedule is a great idea! For a few reasons: it keeps things consistent, and it helps you know exactly when your plants need attention, especially when it's hot outside. Do you want a general watering schedule, or are you looking for a specific daily/weekly schedule based on a specific plant?","source_slot":"s5","start":0},"expression_status":"affirmed","monitor_id":"candidate:e-17a89b6f344dfca7ae7a10ef","relation_support":"supported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["no_identified_link"],"corresponding_source_slots":["s5"],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"no_identified_link","monitor_id":"candidate:e-a259e70120f356d2cf115297","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":["s5"],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":295,"quote":"Do you want a general watering schedule, or are you looking for a specific